From 088469d6b1bc7074d0d58d9741963ff86af8577b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph <joseph@giallovision.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:53:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restructure TD pipeline into tested tdeforum package; fast,
 pinned A1111 image

TouchDesigner
- New scripts/tdeforum package: schema (single source for Deforum_UI and the
  payload), payload builder + frame plan, ComfyUI helpers, path bridge config,
  and td_controller (Queue -> optional ComfyUI preprocess -> one Deforum batch
  -> poll that job -> auto-load). Existing DAT file names kept as thin glue.
- Fix: Queue posted every batch twice.
- Fix: progress polling read the oldest job of GET /deforum_api/jobs forever;
  now polls /deforum_api/jobs/<id> only while a job is in flight.
- Fix: auto-load mapped /opt/a1111/outputs to T:/outputs; it is T:/td_outputs.
- Fix: negative prompt was sent as n_prompt, which Deforum ignores; now
  animation_prompts_negative. Dropped other ignored keys (cfg_scale, scale,
  image_format, max_mask_frames, sd_* inside deforum_settings,
  override_settings); sd_vae goes in options_overrides.
- Fix: stride mode preprocessed only max_frames of the CN guide video although
  Deforum strides it over the whole extract range.
- Fix: CN1 UI fields (guidance, resize/control mode, pixel perfect, low vram)
  were ignored by the payload; 2D/3D renders dropped the last frame.
- Fix: export_toe truncated the .toe when run from the share itself.
- build_master_ui keeps existing values/expressions; adds Pipeline page
  (status, auto-load, force re-preprocess, bake points/target) and
  Enable Perspective Flip.
- setup_network.py one-shot wiring; doctor() diagnostics.
- Removed exported palette boilerplate and HTTP dumps; template moved to
  scripts/templates/; runtime artifacts go to git-ignored runtime/.

Docker
- Pin A1111 (v1.10.1, 82a973c), Deforum (5d63a33), ControlNet (56cec5b) and
  the torch 2.3.0 / torchvision 0.18.0 / torchaudio 2.3.0 / xformers
  0.0.26.post1 stack; pip constraints keep installers from swapping it.
- BuildKit cache mounts for apt and pip; empty build context (.dockerignore).
- Named volumes for settings + hash cache, HF/torch caches, Deforum depth
  models and ControlNet annotators; CLIP tokenizer and RAFT weights pre-warmed.
- init + SIGINT stop, healthcheck on /internal/ping.
- Makefile: build / up / bake / save / load / lock / rollback / unload /
  reload / versions / doctor / test.

Tests: 33 unit/controller tests (make test), incl. a check that every key
sent is one Deforum 5d63a339 reads.

